*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.svg binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ico binary
*.rpa binary
